# canton8_hack

A fresh project scaffold for your Canton8 hackathon work.

## Getting started

```bash
cd canton8_hack
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -e .
python -m canton8_hack.main
```

## Project structure

- `src/canton8_hack/` - application package
- `tests/` - test files
